#: krecord.cpp:339
msgid ""
"Your system is missing the Synth_STEREO_COMPRESSOR aRts module.\n"
"You will be able to use KRec but without the great functions of the "
"compressor."
msgstr ""
"O teu sistema perdeu o módulo Synth_STEREO_COMPRESSOR aRts.\n"
"Ti podrás empregar KRec pero sen as magnificas funcións do compresor."

#: krecord.cpp:340
msgid ""
"Possible reasons are:\n"
"- You installed KRec on its own without the rest of kdemultimedia.\n"
"- You installed everything correctly, but did not restart the aRts daemon\n"
" and therefore it is not aware of the new effects.\n"
"- This is a bug."
msgstr ""
"As posibles causas son:\n"
"- Instalaste KRec en si mesmo sen o resto de kdemultimedia.\n"
"- Instalaste todo correctamente, pero non reiniciastes o daemon\n"
" e, polo tanto, iniciaron os novos efectos.\n"
"- É un erro."

#: krecord.cpp:341
